"``speculative_num_steps`` / ``speculative_num_draft_tokens``. An explicitly "
"provided ``speculative_algorithm`` is left untouched."
msgstr ""
"Traduit en ``--speculative-algorithm NEXTN`` avec les valeurs "
"correspondantes de ``speculative_num_steps`` / "
"``speculative_num_draft_tokens``. Un ``speculative_algorithm`` explicite "
"reste intact."

